<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch AEX share index crosses 800 for first time.</title>
<headline>Dutch AEX share index crosses 800 for first time.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch AEX index of leading shares on Friday broke above 800 points for the first time, beating the previous peak of 799.56 set on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The index opened 6.25 points higher at a record high of 801.27, boosted by a 47 point gain on Wall Street overnight.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
